		{"id":"scan","type":"text","text":"### scan_findings.py, scan_loop.sh\n**Read-only findings scan**\n\n- writes docs/22","x":1170,"y":1686,"width":340,"height":160,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"figs","type":"text","text":"### make_figures.py, make_project_map.py\n**README figures and this map**\n\n- SVG, PNG, Obsidian Canvas","x":800,"y":1876,"width":340,"height":160,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"backup","type":"text","text":"### backup.sh, install_backup.sh\n**Automatic backup**\n\n- post-commit hook + 2-hourly timer\n- local snapshot, then push","x":1170,"y":1876,"width":340,"height":160,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"rank","type":"text","text":"### rank_models.py\n**Top 3 models per circuit**\n\n- clean majority, accuracy, speed","x":1540,"y":1496,"width":340,"height":160,"color":"5"},
