		{"id":"server","type":"text","text":"### app/server.py\n**HTTP server, stdlib only**\n\n- parses netlist, guesses topology/technology\n- adapts the netlist to SAED 90 nm\n- writes job.json, starts the pipeline\n- status API, reaper for zombie runs","x":-40,"y":-380,"width":340,"height":160,"color":"4"},
