		{"id":"pipeline","type":"text","text":"### engine/pipeline.py\n**Pipeline class: the whole flow**\n\n- spec, scenario, DUT precheck\n- N candidates: stimulus, measure, HSPICE\n- script-draft fallback, sanity rules\n- 5 % cluster vote, spec checks, report","x":800,"y":-475,"width":340,"height":160,"color":"1"},
